import Legal from '../../components/Legal.astro';
---
<Legal
  site="academy"
  title="Refunds & Cancellation — Tisvia Marketing Academy"
  heading="Refunds &amp; cancellation"
  description="How to cancel or reschedule your place on the Tisvia Marketing Academy course, and what is refundable."
  updated="10 November 2026"
>
  <p>
    This policy covers the performance marketing course run by Tisvia Marketing Academy. Agency
    services have their own policy on the
    <a href="https://tisviamarketing.in/refund/">Tisvia Marketing site</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>If you cancel</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>7 or more days before the batch starts —</strong> full refund of the fee.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Less than 7 days before, but before the first session —</strong> 50% of the fee is
      refunded. The other half covers the seat we held and turned away.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Once the first session has been delivered —</strong> no refund. The recordings,
      materials and the mentor's time are released from day one.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Moving to a later batch</h2>
  <p>
    If something comes up before your batch starts, you can move your seat to the next batch once,
    free of charge, as long as you tell us at least <strong>48 hours before the first session</strong>.
    After the course has started, a transfer is at our discretion.
  </p>

  <h2>If we postpone or cancel</h2>
  <p>
    If we postpone a batch or cancel it outright, you can move to the next batch or take a
    <strong>full refund</strong>, whichever you prefer. If we cancel part-way through a batch and
    cannot finish it, we refund the sessions not delivered.
  </p>

  <h2>Missed sessions</h2>
  <p>
    Every session is recorded and the recording is yours. Missing a live session is not a ground for
    a refund, and we cannot repeat a live session for one student.
  </p>

  <h2>Removal for conduct</h2>
  <p>
    If you are removed for abusive behaviour, spamming, selling to other students or sharing course
    material, no refund is due. See the <a href="/terms/">Terms &amp; conditions</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Advertising spend</h2>
  <p>
    <strong>Advertising spend is never refundable by us.</strong> It is paid by you, directly to
    Meta or another platform, and is separate from the course fee.
  </p>

  <h2>Results</h2>
  <p>
    The fee buys the training, the practice and the feedback. We do not refund it because a campaign
    did not perform, because clients did not come, or because of what you earned afterwards.
  </p>

  <h2>How refunds are paid</h2>
  <p>
    Approved refunds go back to the original payment method within <strong>7 to 10 working
    days</strong> of approval. Bank processing times are outside our control. Any transaction or
    gateway charge already deducted by a payment provider is not refundable.
  </p>

  <h2>How to cancel</h2>
  <p>
    Message us on WhatsApp or email us, with your name and the batch you booked. We acknowledge
    every cancellation in writing — if you have not heard back from us, assume it has not reached
    us and send it again.
  </p>
</Legal>
